cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'If you use onnx-fp16-guard in research or a product, cite it as below.'
title: 'onnx-fp16-guard: safe float16 conversion for ONNX models'
abstract: >-
  A converter for ONNX models that detects and repairs tensors outside the
  float16 range before conversion. It fixes the silent BatchNorm running-variance
  overflow that degrades fp16 models, keeps ops without fp16 kernels in float32,
  and can fail CI instead of clamping.
authors:
  - name: 'ClearPix'
    website: 'https://clearpix.org'
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: 'https://github.com/SharksevenRo/onnx-fp16-guard'
url: 'https://www.npmjs.com/package/onnx-fp16-guard'
version: 0.1.0
date-released: '2026-10-20'
keywords:
  - onnx
  - float16
  - fp16
  - quantization
  - onnxruntime
  - webgpu
  - model-compression
